Setup			3d_sbbh

### Disk parameters

AspectRatio     	0.02             Thickness over Radius in the disc
Sigma0			1.0e-4		Surface Density at r=1
Alpha			1.0e-3		Uniform kinematic viscosity  (was nu in p3disof)
SigmaSlope		1.0		Slope of surface
FlaringIndex		0.0


### Binary parameters  

#Bbhomegaratio   3.1425837348205774
#Bbhseparation   0.01856635533445112

DampingZone     1.15       # Radial range for damping (in period-ratios). Values smaller than one prevent damping
TauDamp         0.3        # Characteristic time for damping, in units of the inverse local orbital frequency. Higher values means lower damping


ExcludeHill      yes


### Planet parameters

PlanetConfig		planets/earth.cfg
ThicknessSmoothing 	0.11053366		Smoothing parameters in disk thickness


### Numerical method parameters

Disk			YES
OmegaFrame     		1.0
Frame			F
IndirectTerm		No

### Mesh parameters

Nx              1500              # Azimuthal
Ny              750              # Radial
Nz              256              # Colatitude

Xmin            -3.14159265358979323844
Xmax             3.14159265358979323844

Ymin            0.5
Ymax            2.5

Zmin            1.4207963267948966   
Zmax            1.7207963267948966 

### Non-uniform spacing

Spacing         N                     # Non-uniform, from mesh-density function
XMa             0.05
XMb             0.08
XMc             5.4

YMa             0.05
YMb             0.08
YMc             2.5
YMy0            1.0                   # Refinement center in r

ZMA             0.05                  # new   
ZMB             0.08
ZMC             2.0
ZMZ0            1.5707963267948966    # center in  pi/2

### Output control parameters

Ntot			60		Total number of time steps
Ninterm	 		2		Time steps between outputs
DT			0.314159265359	Time step length. 2PI = 1 orbit
OutputDir		@outputs/3d_sbbh_test_planet_3orbits6



Field 			gasdens
PlotLine		field[-1,:,:]
